{
  "id": null,
  "title": "Tracing Dashboard",
  "tags": [
    "tracing",
    "zipkin",
    "distributed"
  ],
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Trace Volume",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(zipkin_collector_spans_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Spans/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1000
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Trace Latency (95th percentile)",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(api_latency_ms_bucket{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "95th percentile",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 500
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1000
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Error Traces",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(api_latency_ms_count{job=~\".*-service-metrics\",http_status=~\"4..|5..\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Error Traces/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Active Services",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{job=~\".*-service-metrics|.*-server-metrics\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Services UP",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 7
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Request Latency Distribution",
      "type": "heatmap",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(api_latency_ms_bucket{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m])",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "heatmap": {
        "xAxis": {
          "show": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "show": true,
          "label": "Latency (ms)"
        },
        "colorScale": "exponential",
        "colorScheme": "interpolateSpectral"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Service Dependencies (Request Flow)",
      "type": "graph",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_client_requests_seconds_count{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} -> {{uri}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "yAxes": [
        {
          "label": "Requests/sec",
          "min": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Slowest Endpoints",
      "type": "table",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(api_latency_ms_bucket{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m])))",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "service": "Service",
              "endpoint": "Endpoint",
              "method": "Method",
              "Value": "95th Percentile (ms)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Request Rate by Service",
      "type": "graph",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(api_latency_ms_count{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "yAxes": [
        {
          "label": "Requests/sec",
          "min": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Error Rate by Service",
      "type": "graph",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(api_latency_ms_count{job=~\".*-service-metrics\",http_status=~\"4..|5..\"}[5m])) / sum by (service) (rate(api_latency_ms_count{job=~\".*-service-metrics\"}[5m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} - Error Rate %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "yAxes": [
        {
          "label": "Error Rate (%)",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Zipkin Integration",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "# Distributed Tracing with Zipkin\n\n## 🔍 **Zipkin UI Access**\n**URL**: [http://localhost:9411](http://localhost:9411)\n\n## 📊 **Key Features Available in Zipkin**\n\n### **Service Map**\n- Visual representation of service dependencies\n- Request flow between microservices\n- Latency breakdown by service\n\n### **Trace Search**\n- Search traces by service name\n- Filter by operation name\n- Search by trace ID or span ID\n- Time range filtering\n\n### **Span Analysis**\n- Detailed timing information for each span\n- Service call hierarchy\n- Error identification\n- Tag and annotation inspection\n\n## 🎯 **How to Use**\n\n1. **Find Slow Requests**: Use the \"Slowest Endpoints\" table above to identify performance issues\n2. **Investigate Errors**: Check the \"Error Rate\" graphs and then search for specific error traces in Zipkin\n3. **Analyze Dependencies**: Use the service map to understand request flows\n4. **Deep Dive**: Click on specific traces in Zipkin to see detailed span information\n\n## 📈 **Correlation with Metrics**\n\nThe metrics shown in this dashboard are correlated with the traces in Zipkin:\n- High latency in metrics → Search for slow traces in Zipkin\n- Error spikes → Find error traces with specific status codes\n- Service dependencies → Visualize in Zipkin service map",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(api_latency_ms_count, service)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 27,
  "version": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Zipkin UI",
      "url": "http://localhost:9411",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ]
}